Added a configurable spin menu where players pick rows to play, one key per row, and claim one reward from each.
Added automatic saving of virtual keys so they are not lost if the server stops unexpectedly.
Fixed crate blocks not being restored on startup or not being removed when using a block other than a chest.
Fixed a single click on a crate sometimes being handled twice on 1.9 and newer servers.
Changed plugin dependencies so the Vulcan Loader controls startup order.
Corrected virtual keys used to open a crate coming back after a crash; key balances are now saved within a second of being used.
